        "title": "Program Pre-Requisites",
        "content": [
          {
            "title": "Is prior experience in Business Management required for program enrollment?",
            "content": [
              "No, the program is designed to be inclusive of all levels of experience. All topics will be covered from the basics, making it suitable for individuals from any field of work."
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Time Commitment",
        "content": [
          {
            "title": "How much time does one need to spend?",
            "content": [
              "Ideally, 30 minutes of preparation time is recommended each day, but students can allocate time according to their own schedules. They can choose to practice, read, or watch videos. Additionally, students must attend live classes on weekends. The schedule for these classes will be shared in advance."
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "What is the duration of the program?",
            "content": [
              "The duration of the program is 12 months."
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Why IIM Visakhapatnam",
        "content": [
          {
            "title": "How is the IIM Visakhapatnam's Business Management program different?",
            "content": [
              "### Three things that make this program world class",
              "- **Advanced Pedagogical Approach:** IIM Visakhapatnam's advanced pedagogical approach, supported by its rank of 29th by NIRF, ensures a cutting-edge, innovative, and effective learning experience. This method fosters deep understanding and real-world application of Business Management concepts.",
              "- **Bridging Ideas to Industry:** IIM Visakhapatnam bridges academic ideas to real-world industry applications through a structured framework, fostering practical learning and career readiness. This ensures that students are not only theoretically knowledgeable but also equipped to tackle contemporary business challenges effectively.",
              "- **Accredian Career Center:** Aligned with our mission to cultivate the leaders of tomorrow, the Accredian Career Center empowers you to confidently launch your career."
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Tell me more about Career Assistance?",
